spans.s:
सं-√ हन् P. -हन्ति, (ind.p. -हत्य, q.v.), to strike or put together, join, shut, close (eyes, wings, hands), RV. &c. &c.;
to beat together, make solid, Suśr.;
to put together i.e. frame, fabricate, ŚāṅkhŚr.;
 (Ā.) to rush together (in battle), meet, encounter (instr.), RV. vii, 56, 22;
 (जिघ्नते), to meet as a friend (instr.), ib. ix, 14, 4;
 (P.) to break, crush, kill, destroy, ib. :
Pass. -हन्यते, to be put together or joined, join, unite (intr.), Śaṃk.;
to become compact or solid, ŚBr. :
Caus. -घातयति, to strike together, kill, destroy utterly, MW.

सं-√ 1. हा Ā. -जिहीते, (pr. p. -जिहान), to rise up, RV.; Br.; GṛŚrS.;
to move about, BhP.;
to obtain, Nalod.

सं-√ 2. हा P. -जहाति, to leave together, Āpast.;
to give up, abandon, MBh. :
Desid. -जिहासति, to wish to leave or desert, Car.

सं-√ हृ P. Ā. -हरति, ˚ते, to bring or draw together, unite, compress, collect, contract, abridge, RV. &c. &c.;
to throw together, mix up, ŚrS.;
to close, clench (the fist), MBh.;
to concentrate (the mind) on (loc.), ib.;
to support, maintain, Jātakam.;
to take or fetch from (abl.), R.;
to lay hold of, attract, take for one's self, appropriate, Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to take away, carry off, rob, AitBr.; MBh.;
to lay or draw aside, withdraw, withhold from (abl.), MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to restrain, curb, check, suppress, ib. ;
to crush together, crumple up, destroy, annihilate (often opp. to √ सृज्, ‘to emit or create’), Up.; MBh. &c.;
 Pass. -ह्रियते, to be brought or put together &c., MBh.; Kāv. &c.:
Caus. -हारयति, ˚ते, to bind t˚ (Ā. ‘one's own hair &c.’, also ‘cut’), GṛŚrS.; Car. : -जिहीर्षति, to wish to bring together &c., ŚBr. :
Intens. -जरीहर्ति, to destroy repeatedly, Cat.

सं-√ हृष् P. -हृष्यति (mc. also Ā. ˚ते), to bristle, stand erect (as the hair of the body from joy or fright), MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to thrill with delight, be glad, rejoice, ib. :
Caus. -हर्षयति, to gladden, delight, R.; Divyāv.

सं-√ ह्राद् Ā. -ह्रादते, to sound or rattle together, MBh.; Hariv. :
Caus. -ह्रादयति, to knock together (with a sound or noise), ĀśvGṛ.;
to resound loudly, MBh.

सं-√ ह्वे Ā. -ह्वयते (Pāṇ. i, 3, 30; Ved. inf. सं॑-ह्वयितवै॑),
to call out loudly, shout together, AV.; ŚBr.;
to relate, make known, Bhaṭṭ.
